    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geometry Jump is a lightning-fast 3D precision platformer that challenges even the most hardcore gamers. Master rapid jumps and razor-sharp reflexes as you navigate through a relentless maze of obstacles where every second counts!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186640/extras/aa0896cf0c7a6c71d8d4ea6cfa198aaf.poster.avif?t=1746379383\" width=598 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186640/extras/aa0896cf0c7a6c71d8d4ea6cfa198aaf.webm?t=1746379383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186640/extras/aa0896cf0c7a6c71d8d4ea6cfa198aaf.mp4?t=1746379383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Runner-based action platforming!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenge yourself with the near impossible!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make a dent in the global rankings!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose the difficulty that adapts to your skill!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite replayability!</p></li></ul>",
